In Pro now — 🟥 Lineups: an alert when a team names a clearly weakened starting XI, and 🧑‍💼 New coach: a separate alert for a team's first match under a new coach.
• sent once the confirmed lineup is out, usually 20–40 min before kick-off;
• which regulars start, which are benched, who is out and why;
• selection rules: the WeakLineupV2 strategy (≈3–4 matches a day);
• this is lineup information, not betting advice.

